#. type: Plain text
#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:73
msgid "`EntityUpdateInput.skip_revision: true` 时不自动归档。惯例："
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:80
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Round | Intent                                                                  |\n"
#| "| ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| 1     | Contradiction detection + expiry marking                                |\n"
#| "| 2     | Split multi-fact entries                                                |\n"
#| "| 3     | Dedup merge similar entries                                             |\n"
#| "| 4     | Pin quality review (unpin stale pins; resident read still capped at 40) |\n"
msgid ""
"| 场景                                        | 建议                                                       |\n"
"| ------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Vault 改主密码只 rewrap `dek_wrapped`       | **必须** skip（并显式写回 `revisions[].body.dek_wrapped`） |\n"
"| 清单删除时子项 `parent_id: null` 等结构挂接 | skip                                                       |\n"
"| 纯排序 / unread 标记翻转                    | 宜 skip（避免挤掉有用内容版本）                            |\n"
"| 用户编辑标题、正文、密文                    | **不要** skip                                              |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 轮次 | 意图                                   |\n"
"| ----- | ---------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 1     | 矛盾检测 + 过期标记 |\n"
"| 2     | 拆分多事实条目                 |\n"
"| 3     | 去重合并相似条目              |\n"
"| 4     | 置顶质量审查（解除过时置顶；常驻读仍上限 40 条）       |\n"

